    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Drive this truckin\u2019 weird and wild world of jumps, traverses and winding ascents. Uncover artifacts, help build the sonic landscape, conquer the summit, and try to clock the fastest time.</h2><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2386850/extras/c1e1112427c1bd133501d13048e3cbc1.webp?t=1745245024\" /></span><br><strong>\u2022 There is no traction control in space! A sandbox of hidden paths, cutty jumps and sonic artifacts.</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2386850/extras/6efece5afd6c51813f89c3bf6a76a889.webp?t=1745245024\" /></span><br><strong>\u2022 Discover shortcuts to clock the best time to the finish line.</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2386850/extras/58b65527af75bdb2741528a08c61044b.webp?t=1745245024\" /></span><br><strong>\u2022 Use checkpoints as your guide or just go exploring.</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2386850/extras/419c17f69b41c48c6705dded6505c445.webp?t=1745245024\" /></span><br><strong>\u2022 It\u2019s a vibrant and psychedelic drive.</strong>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Drive this truckin\u2019 weird and wild world of jumps, traverses and winding ascents. Uncover artifacts, help build the sonic landscape, conquer the summit, and try to clock the fastest time.</h2><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2386850/extras/c1e1112427c1bd133501d13048e3cbc1.webp?t=1745245024\" /></span><br><strong>\u2022 There is no traction control in space! A sandbox of hidden paths, cutty jumps and sonic artifacts.</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2386850/extras/6efece5afd6c51813f89c3bf6a76a889.webp?t=1745245024\" /></span><br><strong>\u2022 Discover shortcuts to clock the best time to the finish line.</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2386850/extras/58b65527af75bdb2741528a08c61044b.webp?t=1745245024\" /></span><br><strong>\u2022 Use checkpoints as your guide or just go exploring.</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2386850/extras/419c17f69b41c48c6705dded6505c445.webp?t=1745245024\" /></span><br><strong>\u2022 It\u2019s a vibrant and psychedelic drive.</strong>",
